              {
                "type": "email",
                "id": "E51"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "On 27 February Jonas asked that the board pre-read figures for Fenmoor stay consistent with the latest lender model.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "type": "email",
                "id": "E56"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "On 6 March Hannah asked to lead Thursday's pre-read with the pricing floor logic.",
            "citations": [
